 "role": "filler", "type": "signature", "label": "Logged / Tagged By"}]}, {"id": "section_2_quality_review_supplier_coordination", "title": "Section 2 — Quality Review & Supplier Coordination", "fields": [{"id": "quality_review_info", "text": "To be filled out by the SQF Practitioner.", "type": "info", "label": "Instructions"}, {"id": "date_supplier_contacted", "type": "date", "label": "Date Supplier Contacted", "width": "full"}, {"id": "supplier_contact_person", "type": "text", "label": "Supplier Contact Person", "width": "full"}, {"id": "associated_scar_number", "type": "text", "label": "Associated SCAR Number", "width": "full"}, {"id": "associated_capa_number", "type": "text", "label": "Associated CAPA Number", "width": "full"}, {"id": "qa_evaluation_testing_notes", "type": "textarea", "label": "QA Evaluation & Testing Notes (internal spec verification / lab testing findings)", "width": "full"}]}, {"id": "section_3_final_disposition_release_authorizatio", "title": "Section 3 — Final Disposition & Release Authorization", "fields": [{"id": "final_disposition_info", "text": "To be filled out by the SQF Practitioner.", "type": "info", "label": "Instructions"}, {"id": "final_disposition_decision", "type": "select", "label": "Final Disposition Decision (check one)", "options": ["APPROVED FOR PRODUCTION RELEASE: Material is confirmed compliant or an acceptable deviation.", "RETURN TO SUPPLIER: Arranged under the approved supplier agreement terms.", "REWORK: Approved under overseen rework protocols.", "DESTRUCTION / DISPOSAL: Material cannot be salvaged; verified disposal completed."]}, {"id": "justification_for_final_disposition", "type": "textarea", "label": "Justification for Final Disposition", "width": "full"}, {"id": "verification_check", "type": "checkbox", "label": "Verification Check", "width": "full"}, {"id": "name_title", "type": "text", "label": "Name & Title", "width": "full"}, {"id": "authorized_quality_leader_signature", "role": "verifier", "type": "signature", "label": "Signature", "width": "half"}, {"id": "signature_date", "type": "date", "label": "Date", "width": "half"}]}], "settings": {}, "schemaVersion": 1}, "revision_history": "v2 - 2026-10-29 - Role names and retention aligned to FSQM-004 and SOP-2.2.3 (readiness review). Labels and help text only; no revision change, so entries already made stay on this revision."}$jx$::jsonb,
