abel": "Expiry / Notes"}]}]}, {"id": "section_3_supplier_evaluation_criteria", "title": "Section 3 — Supplier Evaluation Criteria", "fields": [{"id": "info_evaluation_program", "text": "Required by the SQF 2.3.4.2 evaluation program.", "type": "info", "label": "Evaluation program"}, {"id": "supplier_evaluation_grid", "rows": {"mode": "fixed", "labels": ["Maintains controlled & current specifications", "Processes capable of consistently meeting specification & quality metrics (delivery, service)", "Provides evidence supplied product meets agreed specifications & metrics (COA / audit)", "Complaint-management system with corrective-action process in place", "Agreement for return / disposal of non-conforming or damaged material"]}, "type": "grid", "label": "Supplier Evaluation Criteria", "columns": [{"id": "status", "type": "select", "label": "Met / Not / NA", "options": ["Met", "Not", "NA"]}, {"id": "evidence_notes", "type": "text", "label": "Evidence / Notes"}]}]}, {"id": "section_4_approval_decision", "title": "Section 4 — Approval Decision", "fields": [{"id": "supplier_status", "type": "select", "label": "Supplier Status", "options": ["APPROVED – meets all documentation or recognized-distributor requirements.", "CONDITIONALLY APPROVED – lacks one or more documents but poses low food-safety risk (recognized distributor).", "REJECTED – cannot demonstrate food-safety compliance or product traceability."]}, {"id": "conditional_rejection_rationale", "type": "textarea", "label": "Conditional / Rejection Rationale"}, {"id": "next_annual_review_due", "type": "date", "label": "Next Annual Review Due"}]}, {"id": "section_5_authorization", "title": "Section 5 — Authorization", "fields": [{"id": "evaluated_approved_by_qa_manager_owner", "role": "verifier", "type": "signature", "label": "Evaluated & Approved By (SQF Practitioner)"}, {"id": "evaluation_date", "type": "date", "label": "Date", "width": "half"}, {"id": "info_on_approval", "text": "Materials may only be purchased from approved suppliers (SQF 2.3.4.1).", "type": "info", "label": "On Approval"}]}], "settings": {}, "schemaVersion": 1}, "revision_history": "New - 2026-10-29 - Role names and retention aligned to FSQM-004 and SOP-2.2.3 (readiness review). Labels and help text only; no revision change, so entries already made stay on this revision."}$jx$::jsonb,
